{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-16"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811301-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"시스라단 부족의 황무지를 천천히 이동하다 돼지 같은 형상의 겁쟁이 서열 생물 세 마리가 당신과 마주친다. 그들의 반응은 각기 달랐는데, 하나는 벌벌 떨고, 하나는 도망치려는 자세를 취하고, 나머지 하나는 전투태세를 취하고 있다","talkId":403811301,"textHash":"9139019433124678099","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/talk-403811301","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"602b09484e7003cf","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811302-line"],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811302-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 스타피스 가이드의 설명을 떠올린다: 「서열 저금통」이라 불리는 다른 차원의 생물로 일생의 대부분의 시간을 음식 섭취와 도망치는 데 보낸다","talkId":403811302,"textHash":"16915053951338844390","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/talk-403811302","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"602b09484e7003cf","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811303-line"],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811303-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「서열 저금통」을 만난 건 길조이다. 당신은 대책을 생각하기 시작한다. 평소 놀이를 할 때처럼, 서열 저금통의 성격에 따라 상대할 순서를 결정하면 될 것이다","talkId":403811303,"textHash":"17053144054812305055","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/talk-403811303","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"602b09484e7003cf","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-1023077037857571244-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"당신은 우수한 저금통 보호 의식을 전파했다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1023077037857571244","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/text-1023077037857571244","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8aff6c250bd7dae4","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-13045015281404764024-effect"],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-13045015281404764024-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"저금통의 속도와 받는 피해 감소. 승리 후 축복 선택 시 출현하는 모든 축복이 강화된다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13045015281404764024","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/text-13045015281404764024","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"8aff6c250bd7dae4","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-1023077037857571244-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-8817212867898905987-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"저금통을 잡는 요령은… 빠른 속도다!","talkId":null,"textHash":"8817212867898905987","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/text-8817212867898905987","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4b75dda87768826e","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-5776362996466357165-effect"],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-5776362996466357165-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"저금통의 속도 대폭 상승. 승리 후 축복 선택 시 출현하는 모든 축복이 강화된다","talkId":null,"textHash":"5776362996466357165","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/text-5776362996466357165","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4b75dda87768826e","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-8817212867898905987-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-4449543495391527525-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"서열 저금통과 논다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4449543495391527525","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/text-4449543495391527525","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"37b7c43b87a7c678","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-1118828564445361638-effect"],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-1118828564445361638-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-16","missionId":"event-rogue-16","mission":"아기 돼지 3형제","scene":"아기 돼지 3형제","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"저금통 세 마리의 방에 들어간다. 도망가지 않도록 조심하자","talkId":null,"textHash":"1118828564445361638","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:16/text-1118828564445361638","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"37b7c43b87a7c678","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"三只小猪","bwikiRevision":96377,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8735","bwikiMission":"아기 돼지 3형제","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-4449543495391527525-choice"]}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811301-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811302-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-talk-403811303-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-1023077037857571244-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-13045015281404764024-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-8817212867898905987-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-5776362996466357165-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-4449543495391527525-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-16-text-1118828564445361638-effect"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":9,"reviewRows":0,"segments":4,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}